# Trivy ignore file — CVE IDs listed here are skipped during scans.
#
# Format: one CVE ID per line. Comments start with #.
# Each entry MUST have an expiry date comment on the next line:
#   CVE-XXXX-XXXXX
#   # expires: 2026-12-31 — reason: <short explanation>
#
# Review this file monthly. Expired entries should be removed
# once the upstream package is updated or the vulnerability is
# no longer applicable.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2024-12345
# # expires: 2026-12-31 — reason: no fix available for php-8.5-alpine yet

